TVLWeightedContainers::getTotalTvlForEpoch()
├── given no active containers exist
│   └── it should return zero TVL
├── given single active container exists
│   ├── when container has no TVL for the epoch
│   │   └── it should return zero TVL
│   ├── when container has TVL for the epoch
│   │   └── it should return the container's TVL amount
│   └── when querying future epoch that has no TVL
│       └── it should return zero TVL
├── given multiple active containers exist
│   ├── when no containers have TVL for the epoch
│   │   └── it should return zero TVL
│   ├── when only one container has TVL for the epoch
│   │   └── it should return that container's TVL amount
│   ├── when multiple containers have TVL for the epoch
│   │   └── it should return sum of all containers' TVL
│   └── when containers have different TVL amounts
│       └── it should return correct sum of all TVL amounts
├── given mix of active and inactive containers
│   ├── when both active and inactive containers have TVL
│   │   └── it should only count TVL from active containers
│   └── when only inactive containers have TVL
│       └── it should return zero TVL
├── given containers are deactivated after having TVL
│   └── it should not count TVL from deactivated containers
├── given querying historical epochs
│   ├── when historical epoch had different active containers
│   │   └── it should return TVL based on containers that were active at query time
│   └── when historical epoch had no TVL data
│       └── it should return zero TVL
├── given TVL updates with add and subtract operations
│   ├── when TVL is added first
│   │   └── it should return the added amount
│   └── when TVL is subtracted after adding
│       └── it should return the net amount after subtraction
├── given maximum number of active containers (16)
│   └── when all containers have TVL
│       └── it should return sum of all 16 containers' TVL
└── given edge cases with mixed TVL values
    ├── when one container has zero TVL among non-zero containers
    │   └── it should correctly sum only non-zero TVL amounts
    └── when containers have very large TVL amounts
        └── it should handle large numbers without overflow
